agent-tools (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * claude-sync: new tool. Two-way sync of Claude Code sessions between two
    machines over ssh and rsync, so a session can be resumed on either one.
    A session continued on both machines is chained into one conversation,
    with both originals kept as conflict copies.

 -- Christopher Hoover <ch@murgatroid.com>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:49:36 -0700

agent-tools (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=low

  * agent-ps: keep INFO on one row and cut it to the terminal width; a prompt
    passed in argv no longer spills across the table. Add --wide to disable.

 -- Christopher Hoover <ch@murgatroid.com>  Fri, 02 Oct 2026 14:23:35 -0700

